      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-24T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "As the Wikipedia article records, the flow of commercial goods into Gaza stopped in October 2026, greatly affecting supplies for the Gazan population.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1387464354:332"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-24T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "The Gaza war is an armed conflict in the Gaza Strip and Israel, part of the unresolved Israeli–Palestinian and Gaza–Israel conflicts.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1387464354:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-24T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "The reports place the events in the Gaza Strip.",
