      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-24T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "The reports also name the Levant.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-24:2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-24T00:00:42Z",
      "text": "The Washington Post is credited as the outlet reporting this story.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-24:2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-24T00:00:50Z",
      "text": "France 24 headlined its report that Israeli strikes on Gaza killed a senior Hamas security official and six other people, according to medics.",
      "cites": [
        "news:france24:d1ad5b170216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-24T00:00:56Z",
